{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01GKj1ZYqfTuJyRCcxf8KMdk","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t## 2026-04-12-2130-pipeline-round0-kernel-launches\n2\t\n3\t**Idea**: Eliminate per-AIR GPU synchronization in Round 0 by restructuring the loop into prepare/launch/collect phases.\n4\t\n5\t**Result**: failure — Round 0 at APC 300: 665ms → 645ms (1.03x lower vs baseline 662ms). STARK excl trace at APC 300: 2479ms → 2452ms (vs previous: -27ms, 1.01x lower)."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"f6a29d98-72ec-4762-837c-743bc80ebea8","uuid":"c26c730c-67d5-4c6c-b156-54ca9708d55a","timestamp":"2026-04-14T05:46:43.921Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/georg/stark-backend/autoopt-results/log.md","content":"## 2026-04-12-2130-pipeline-round0-kernel-launches\n\n**Idea**: Eliminate per-AIR GPU synchronization in Round 0 by restructuring the loop into prepare/launch/collect phases.\n\n**Result**: failure — Round 0 at APC 300: 665ms → 645ms (1.03x lower vs baseline 662ms). STARK excl trace at APC 300: 2479ms → 2452ms (vs previous: -27ms, 1.01x lower).","numLines":5,"startLine":1,"totalLines":168}}}
